The register catalogue, device profile and owner-handshake adaptation were
written for Segway Monitor using these protocol and implementation references.
The application adds a native Windows interface, German parameter explanations,
model filtering, telemetry presentation, exports and local credential storage.
The bundled scootscoot library is used without modifications.

